{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほーい、みさみさだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7200149/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は撮影でした ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれ順番呼ばれてから\nカメラの前に立つと キリッ‼って\n表情変わるの見てて\n「やっぱみんなアイドルやな～(･･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7200149/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\nってしみじみ思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこと言ったら 若月ぃから\n「そんな自分もアイドル(笑)」\nっとか言われそう！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー紹介第一弾っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記念すべき一回目は.......\nべひたんこと、伊藤万理華  ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかfamの方へ。\nこの子は本当に手がかかります。\nお姉たまはもういつも大変です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「キャハハッ、キャハハ♪\n♪──Ｏ（≧∇≦）Ｏ──♪\nねーねー （≧∇≦）」\nっていつもはしゃいでる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてみさのことを\nなぜか『みさ先輩』と呼ぶ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間 みさが マンション見て\n『こんな大きなマンションにメンバー\n全員で住んだら絶対楽しいよな～♡』\nって言ったら\n『みさ先輩と同じ部屋に住む \\(//∇//)\\』\nって言ってきたり。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々ころにはデレデレなみさに\n『なんで寧々にはそんな甘いん⁇\nうちにも優しくしてよ～な～（ ;  ; ）\nあ～もう知らんからなっ‼ 』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って拗ねてどっか行って\nしばらくするとすぐ戻ってくる ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7200149/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ見てまた\n嬉しいー♪──Ｏ（≧∇≦）Ｏ─♪\nって騒ぐんやろうな...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼肉連れてけーっちうるさいけど\nまぁ、考えてあげても いいよ？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...なんて優しい先輩ヽ(；▽；)ノ ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも明るくて 元気いっぱいで\nはしゃいでる 甘えん坊だけど\nダンスの時とかに魅せる\n真剣な表情や大人っぽい仕草\nギャップが凄く魅力的だと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やる時は、やる！！ってね。\n自分に厳しいし 意見をいう時は\nちゃんと言える。\nまりかのいい所だと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなまりかのことが\nだいすきだよいつも言わんけど！\n....もう言わんよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7200149/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は誰の紹介しようかな～♪\n誰が、いい？？(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の私服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7200149/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7200149/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このスカート お気に入り♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまた更新します～！"}],"source":"archive"}